WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.330
Then, I saw something! It was a festival -- a big festival!

2
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.070
It is the Smithsonian Folklife Festival.

3
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:15.230
Yes. It was the Smithsonian Folklife Festival.

4
00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:18.710
Every year the festival shows different cultures.

5
00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:22.790
This year one of the cultures was the Basque culture.

6
00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.350
There was dancing and food and games!

7
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.810
I am dancing a traditional Basque dance.

8
00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:39.230
At the festival, I danced a traditional Basque dance!

9
00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:52.830
They are cooking traditional Basque food.

10
00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:57.510
They cooked a lot of traditional Basque food.

11
00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:15.270
They are playing a game.

12
00:01:15.580 --> 00:01:16.990
It’s a kind of handball.

13
00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:18.810
What do they call it?

14
00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:20.450
They call it pilota!

15
00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.930
They played a game with their hands and a small ball.

16
00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.390
It’s a kind of handball.

17
00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.370
But this game is called pilota.

18
00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.210
This is beautiful!

19
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:50.830
This is traditional Basque art.

20
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:09.430
They are making a traditional Basque ship.

21
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.390
This festival is a lot of fun!

22
00:02:22.420 --> 00:02:24.890
The whole day was a lot of fun!

23
00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:25.810
Who said that?

24
00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:30.430
I want to write my friends and tell them about my day!

25
00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:08.130
... So, I wanted to tell you about my day!

26
00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:12.010
Please, my friend, come visit Washington, D.C. soon.

27
00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:13.950
There is a lot to do!

28
00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:16.430
Until next time … Anna.
